OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785163697
OL,3,CDublin museum employee charged with
OL,4,Cpossessing explosives in Irish border
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FAn employee at a Dublin museum has
OL,8,Fbeen remanded in custody after
OL,9,Fappearing in court charged with
OL,10,Fpossession of explosives that were
OL,11,Fintercepted in a car near the Irish
OL,12,Fborder.
OL,14,FSimon O'Donovan, 44, with an address
OL,15,Fat Sperrin Road in Drimnagh, appeared
OL,16,Fbefore the Special Criminal Court at
OL,17,Fthe Criminal Courts of Justice in
OL,18,FDublin on Saturday evening.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785163697
OL,3,CDublin museum employee charged with
OL,4,Cpossessing explosives in Irish border
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FO'Donovan also represented himself in
OL,8,Fa bail hearing before the High Court,
OL,9,Fwhere his application for bail was
OL,10,Frefused after gardai raised objections.
OL,12,FThe court was told during this hearing
OL,13,Fthat he was employed at the Collins
OL,14,FBarracks National Museum.
OL,26,@rD@Trt
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
