OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785163697
OL,3,CDublin museum employee charged with
OL,4,Cpossessing explosives in Irish border
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FDetective Sergeant Shane Noone told
OL,8,Fthe court that he arrested Mr
OL,9,FO'Donovan at 5.07pm on Saturday and
OL,10,Finformed him he would be charged with
OL,11,Fpossession of explosives at St
OL,12,FLaurence's Road in Chapelizod on
OL,13,FWednesday July 22.
OL,15,FAfter cautioning, Mr Noone said
OL,16,FO'Donovan replied "I don't understand"
OL,17,Fand was informed of the caution again.
OL,26,@xD@SOUxD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785163697
OL,3,CDublin museum employee charged with
OL,4,Cpossessing explosives in Irish border
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FDarragh Mackin of Phoenix Law said he
OL,8,Fhad not taken instruction from
OL,9,FO'Donovan due to a solicitors' strike
OL,10,Fover changes to criminal legal aid
OL,11,Ffees and was only appearing in court
OL,12,Fout of courtesy.
OL,14,FO'Donovan told Judge Patrick McGrath
OL,15,Fthat he had "no representation at
OL,16,Fall", and had asked for "the services
OL,17,Fof this gentleman beside me",
OL,18,Freferring to Mr Mackin.
OL,26,@wD@MOUxD@DO]xD@YOUyD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785163697
OL,3,CDublin museum employee charged with
OL,4,Cpossessing explosives in Irish border
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FThe court rose briefly so that
OL,8,FO'Donovan could confer with Mr Mackin
OL,9,Fon an application for bail.
OL,11,FWhen it returned, Mr O'Donovan said he
OL,12,Fwas looking to represent himself in a
OL,13,Fbail hearing before the High Court as
OL,14,Fhe did not have the means to contest
OL,15,Fit privately.
OL,17,FHe said the situation was "grossly
OL,18,Funfair", and that he would be "willing
OL,19,Fto try" a bail hearing and that his
OL,20,Ffamily and friends were present in
OL,21,Fcourt.
OL,26,@yD@[OUzD@GO]zD@_OU{D@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785163697
OL,3,CDublin museum employee charged with
OL,4,Cpossessing explosives in Irish border
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FState solicitor Liam Mulholland said
OL,8,Fit was "very unusual" to apply for
OL,9,Fbail late in the day in "a matter such
OL,10,Fas this", but added that if a person
OL,11,Fwants to apply for bail then the court
OL,12,Fhas to hear the application.
OL,14,FThe three-judge Special Criminal Court
OL,15,Fremanded him in custody until Monday
OL,16,Fand rose.
OL,26,@pD@HOUpD@UO]qD@YOUrD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785163697
OL,3,CDublin museum employee charged with
OL,4,Cpossessing explosives in Irish border
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FJudge McGrath then returned a few
OL,8,Fminutes later for a sitting of the
OL,9,FHigh Court to hear O'Donovan's bail
OL,10,Fapplication, which was refused after
OL,11,Fobjections were raised by gardai.
OL,13,FDuring the bail application, O'Donovan
OL,14,Ftold the court: "Just to state on the
OL,15,Frecord that it seems to be quite
OL,16,Funfair and there doesn't seem to be
OL,17,Fcontinuity about how bail is granted,
OL,18,Fsome people who can afford can, and
OL,19,Fsome people who can't are left without
OL,20,Fit."
OL,26,@sD@`rtvD@QOU|D@DO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
