FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785163697
OL,3,CDublin museum employee charged with
OL,4,Cpossessing explosives in Irish border
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FO'Donovan is due to appear in person
OL,8,Fbefore the Special Criminal Court in
OL,9,FDublin on Monday.
OL,11,FHe blew kisses to his supporters in
OL,12,Fcourt before being remanded in custody.
OL,14,FOn Wednesday, a vehicle travelling on
OL,15,Fthe N2 near Carrickmacross in Co
OL,16,FMonaghan was stopped and searched by
OL,17,Fgardai.
OL,26,@yD@Frt
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
