FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785163697
OL,3,CDublin museum employee charged with
OL,4,Cpossessing explosives in Irish border
OL,5,Ccase
OL,7,FLaw student Isobella Perrie Sullivan,
OL,8,F25, of Abbeylands Park in Clane, Co
OL,9,FKildare, appeared before a district
OL,10,Fcourt on Friday, charged with
OL,11,Fpossession of explosives in relation
OL,12,Fto the case.
OL,14,FHer solicitor Gavin Booth of Phoenix
OL,15,FLaw said she had been asked to take a
OL,16,Fbag to the north and had not been
OL,17,Faware what was in it.
OL,19,FPerrie Sullivan was granted bail but
OL,20,Fremains in custody ahead of a further
OL,21,Fbail hearing on Monday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
